      "comparisonSentence": "Compared to deep-fried meat packages and heavy balado stir-fries, these clear soups, steamed dishes, and fresh vegetables provide fiber, micronutrients, and minimal saturated fat.",
      "message": "This group represents the most health-preserving choices on the menu. Clear soups (Sop Ayam Kampung) and steamed items (Pepes Tahu) avoid deep-frying oils, while raw vegetables (Lalapan Rebus) and sour tamarind soups (Sayur Asem) supply valuable dietary fiber and antioxidants without spiking cardiovascular risk factors.",
      "orderingTip": "Opt for Sayur Asem or Lalapan Rebus as your primary side dishes, and choose clear broth soups over coconut or fried bases to protect cardiovascular health."
