      "comparisonSentence": "These complete fried meal packages and chili-laden balado dishes contain significantly more saturated fat and sodium than the steamed or clear soup options.",
      "message": "Deep-fried poultry, fish, and beef packages (Paket Ayam/Bebek/Lele) combined with rich seasoning pastes deliver a heavy load of saturated fats and sodium. Regular consumption contributes to arterial stiffness and elevated blood pressure. Enjoy these as occasional treats rather than daily staples.",
      "orderingTip": "Ask for grilled ('bakar') instead of fried ('goreng') protein options whenever possible, and request sambal on the side to manage sodium and spice levels."
